infographic hierarchy-tree-curved-line-rounded-rect-node
data
  root
    label Safe subprocess.run = list args + check=True + timeout=
    children
      - label List of args (shell=False) — no shell, no injection
        children
          - label Python execs the program directly via execve — /bin/sh is never in the chain
          - label A hostile filename x.png; rm -rf ~ is one inert argv entry, not a 2nd command
      - label check=True — failures surface instead of passing silently
        children
          - label Non-zero exit raises CalledProcessError instead of returning quietly
          - label Catches the cron backup whose pg_dump exited non-zero unnoticed for months
      - label timeout= — a hung child can't hang you
        children
          - label Raises TimeoutExpired and kills a child that overruns the seconds limit
          - label Catches the malformed upload that looped convert and pinned a worker
theme
  palette #6366f1 #f59e0b #14b8a6
